---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title={"Help and Contact | Change My Name UK"}
  description={"Questions about the free name change checklist, research calls, the beta or privacy. Email hello@changemynameuk.com."}
  path={"/help/"}
  ogTitle={"Help and Contact"}
  navCurrent={"/help/"}
>
<main id="main" class="wrap narrow doc">
  <h1>Help and contact</h1>
  <p class="lede">Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@changemynameuk.com">hello@changemynameuk.com</a> and we'll reply within a couple of working days.</p>

  <section class="faq flush">
    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <details><summary>Is the checklist free?</summary><p>Yes. You don't need to sign up, and your answers stay on your device. <a href="/check/">Get your checklist</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Are you part of the government?</summary><p>No. Change My Name UK is independent. The checklist links to the official gov.uk pages wherever it can.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I need a deed poll?</summary><p>Usually not. <a href="/guides/do-i-need-a-deed-poll/">Read our guide</a> or use the <a href="/check/">free checklist</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What's the £7 voucher for?</summary><p>We're researching how people change their name. If you do a 15 minute call with us about how it's going, we'll send you a £7 Amazon voucher as thanks. <a href="/call/">Book a call</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What's the beta?</summary><p>We're testing a service that does the legwork for you. <a href="/beta/">Find out more and apply</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can you help with visas or immigration?</summary><p>No. Please speak to an adviser regulated by the Immigration Advice Authority.</p></details>
    <details><summary>I live in Scotland or Northern Ireland. Does the checklist work for me?</summary><p>Yes. It asks where you live and adjusts the steps, for example for DVA in Northern Ireland and deed polls in Scotland.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I delete my details?</summary><p>Email us and we'll delete anything you've sent us. Your checklist answers are only on your device, so clearing your browser's site data removes them. See our <a href="/privacy.html">privacy notice</a>.</p></details>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
